    <string name="settings_limits">Android limitations</string>
    <string name="settings_limits_body">Android allows only the app you are using to read the clipboard, so this app cannot detect what you copy in other apps. It never uses accessibility services or other workarounds. Send content with the share sheet, the Paste button, or the “Send clipboard” shortcut. Writing received content to the clipboard works while the app is open or the background connection is on. Images and files are not supported yet.</string>
